## Parameters

<ParamField header="Idempotency-Key" type={"string"} required>
Identifies one logical mutation across retries.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="id" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>


## Returns

**`202`** The provision was accepted and is running. GET the Location after the Retry-After interval until `state` is terminal; the response there carries the line once one is claimed. Operation

Headers: `Location`. The raw response carries these headers; see [Raw responses](/api-client/raw-responses).

